meta {
  name: HospitalApi - Auth - Reset Password
}

env {
  baseUrl = "http://localhost:3000"
}

### Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password/{{resetToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "newpassword1"
}

# Notes:
# - Replace `{{resetToken}}` with the token obtained from the forgot-password flow.
# - Ensure `newpassword1` meets the password validation rules.
